OL,3,GNEWSAControversial rally begins - what
OL,4,Ayou need to know
OL,5,
OL,6,FA two-day car rally event gets under
OL,7,Fway in Shropshire on Saturday following
OL,8,Fmonths of organisation - and backlash.
OL,10,FOrganisers of the Hills Ford Stages
OL,11,FRally have said the event will bring
OL,12,Ftop-level closed-road rallying to the
OL,13,Fcounty, while attracting thousands of
OL,14,Fspectators and boosting the local
OL,15,Feconomy.
OL,17,FBut a number of residents, businesses
OL,18,Fand parish councils have raised
OL,19,Fconcerns about disruption, and have
OL,20,Fcalled for it to be cancelled or
OL,21,Frerouted.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
